<%- include("partials/header") %>
<section class="wrap narrow">
  <h1>How we share your request</h1>
  <p><%= companyName %> sells each homeowner request as an <strong>exclusive lead</strong>: we share it with one partner roofing contractor, not a marketplace of competing bidders.</p>
  <p>We keep a private roster of metro Atlanta roofing companies we may offer a lead to. That roster can change. The partner who receives your request is the seller who may contact you under the consent you signed on the form. We store the exact consent language, the time, and technical details of the submission so both we and the partner can show how consent was obtained.</p>
  <p>We do not scrape homeowner phone numbers, and we do not place cold marketing calls or texts. If you want your information removed after you submit a request, email <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>.</p>
  <p>Roofing companies that want to buy exclusive, opt-in inspection requests can email <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>.</p>
</section>
<%- include("partials/footer") %>
